    forget

    Input gas:mekanism:uranium_oxide From Each Oxidizer Top Side
        Output gas:mekanism:uranium_oxide To ME_Face Top Side Slots 9-12
    forget

End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input gas:mekanism:sulfuric_acid From ME_Face Top Side Slots 2
        Output gas:mekanism:sulfuric_acid To Each Dissolution Bottom Side
    forget

    Input mekanism:fluorite_gem From ME_Face Top Side Slots 1
        Output retain 64 mekanism:fluorite_gem To Each Dissolution Bottom Side
    forget

    Input gas:mekanism:hydrofluoric_acid From Each Dissolution Top Side 
        Output gas:mekanism:hydrofluoric_acid To ME_Face Top Side Slots 9-12
    forget

End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input gas:mekanism:hydrofluoric_acid From ME_Face Top Side Slots 3
        Output gas:mekanism:hydrofluoric_acid To Each Infuser Bottom Side Slots 0
    forget

    Input gas:mekanism:uranium_oxide From ME_Face Top Side Slots 4
        Output gas:mekanism:uranium_oxide To Each Infuser Top Side Slots 0
    forget

    Input gas:mekanism:uranium_hexafluoride From Each Infuser West Side Slots 0
        Output gas:mekanism:uranium_hexafluoride To ME_Face Top Side Slots 9-12
    forget

End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input gas:mekanism:uranium_hexafluoride From ME_Face Top Side Slots 5
        Output gas:mekanism:uranium_hexafluoride To Each Isotopic Bottom Side Slots 0
    forget

    Input gas:mekanism:fissile_fuel From Each Isotopic West Side Slots 0
